  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REHAB POWER STATION PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE ULTIMATE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROJECT WILL BE TO INCREASE THE GENERATING CAPACITY OF JORDANIAN ELECTRICITY AUTHORTY IN POWER SYSTEM TO COPE WITH THE GROWING DEMAND UPTO THE END OF 1997 AND TO COVER PEAK LOAD DEMAND AFTERWARDS. THIS WILL BE ACHIEVED BY INSTALLING GAS TURBINE GENERATOR UNIT RATED 92 MW AT SITE.</narrative>
  </description>
